* Nil interface values

A ⟪GTI18N_2897922c_000001⟫ interface value holds neither value nor concrete type.

Calling a method on a ⟪GTI18N_2897922c_000002⟫ interface is a run-time error because there is no
type inside the interface tuple to indicate which ⟪GTI18N_2897922c_000003⟫concrete⟪GTI18N_2897922c_000004⟫ method to call.

